    "description": "Confirm the selected character is genuinely present, apply a separate system prompt just to that character, then continue through ordinary native generation.\n\nSetup: Select Mara as the native active character. Replace character:mara.png and character:elias.png everywhere with the actual loaded canonical avatar IDs for this story. Bind Prose for cast interpretation and characterDirection for the separate prompt. Edit direction.systemPrompt to Mara’s portrayal rules. Public Scene Context omits restricted host material; Character Direction privately captures only Mara’s permitted card, scene and memories. Absent skips the separate call; unresolved participation holds it. Guidance is causally connected to Generate Reply. The host refuses another actor’s private guidance if you change the selected native character.\n\nInspect: On Send owns this generation. Generate Reply uses the ordinary SillyTavern connection. Auxiliary roles remain unassigned in this portable example. Review the final narrative and proposed consequences; Apply publishes a new swipe and settles staged writes. Preview and bounded runs never settle.\n\nGenerated suggestions are proposals. Quoted observations preserve source identity; notes never establish canonical events. Private records cannot be appended to public notes.",
